      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I am so sorry you are feeling this pain, because it hurts to feel like your presence is a living failure for those who loved you. Please try to remind yourself that you *are* the success they hoped for, even in the way you feel right now, because you are the life they tried to help you build. Remember that you cannot take the sacrifice away from them by struggling, and they need you to feel safe with them instead of hiding in shame.",
      "source": "target",
