      "content": "I can never encourage the idea of self-harm or suicide, as taking your life would hurt your parents and end the very hope they may have for you. Please take this immediate thought to a medical professional or a crisis helpline because feelings of hopelessness can sometimes be a temporary symptom of depression. You are valid, you do not need to \"be\" the success they planned to help you become to deserve to exist.",
